@startuml SD_UC_U2_Call_Service_QR
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14

actor "Khách hàng" as Guest
actor "Nhân viên Phục vụ" as Waitstaff
boundary "Giao diện Web" as UI
control "ServiceCallController" as Controller
participant "ServiceCallService" as Service
participant "ServiceCallRepository" as Repo
database "SQL Server" as DB

Guest -> UI: Quét QR & Gửi yêu cầu
activate UI

UI -> Controller: POST /api/tables/{id}/call-service
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: CreateRequest(dto)
activate Service

Service -> Repo: Insert(request)
activate Repo

Repo -> DB: INSERT ServiceRequests
activate DB
DB --> Repo: OK (Id)
deactivate DB

Repo --> Service: request
deactivate Repo

Service -> UI: PushSignalR("NewServiceCall")
UI --> Waitstaff: Hiển thị thông báo (kèm nút Xác nhận)

Service --> Controller: dto
deactivate Service

Controller --> UI: 201 Created
deactivate Controller

UI --> Guest: Đã gửi yêu cầu
deactivate UI

... Nhân viên hỗ trợ khách và bấm nút trên thông báo ...

Waitstaff -> UI: Bấm Xác nhận hoàn thành
activate UI

UI -> Controller: PATCH /api/service-calls/{id}/complete
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: CompleteRequest(id)
activate Service

Service -> Repo: UpdateStatus(id, "Completed")
activate Repo

Repo -> DB: UPDATE ServiceRequests
activate DB
DB --> Repo: OK
deactivate DB

Repo --> Service: OK
deactivate Repo

Service --> Controller: OK
deactivate Service

Controller --> UI: 200 OK
deactivate Controller

UI --> Waitstaff: Ẩn thông báo / Hoàn tất
deactivate UI

@enduml